OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear spells and showers overnight,
OL,7,Fthe showers heaviest and most
OL,8,Fwidespread across northern England and
OL,9,Fnorth Wales with the potential for
OL,10,Fthunderstorms. Chilly in some rural
OL,11,Fparts of Scotland, milder further
OL,12,Fsouth.
OL,13,
OL,14,CThursday:FSunny spells and scattered
OL,15,Fshowers. The focus for the heaviest
OL,16,Fshowers will transfer to other areas
OL,17,Fof England and Wales, with thunder
OL,18,Fagain possible. Feeling cool in the
OL,19,Fnortherly breeze.
